[0.017, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[27A  Skills solve this using \u001b[1mprogressive disclosure\u001b[m:\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J\n\u001b[4C\u001b[38;5;252m[User Prompt] ──▶ Agent matches prompt against short skill descriptions\u001b[m\n\u001b[71D\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[24X\u001b[24C│\u001b[m\n\u001b[25D\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[24X\u001b[24C▼ (Matches?)\u001b[m\n\u001b[36D\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[18X\u001b[18CLoads full SKILL.md & runs helper scripts on-demand\u001b[m\r\n\n  1. \u001b[1mLightweight Indexing\u001b[m: By default, only the skill’s \u001b[94mname\u001b[m and \u001b[94mdescription\u001b[m (from its YAML metadata) are exposed\r\n  to the agent.\r\n  2. \u001b[1mOn-Demand Loading\u001b[m: When your prompt matches what the skill does, the agent dynamically reads the full \u001b[94mSKILL.\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94mmd\u001b[m instructions and any relevant reference files.\r\n  3. \u001b[1mExecution\u001b[m: The agent follows the defined steps and executes any bundled helper scripts.\r\n  ──────\r\n  \u001b[1m### 3. Structure of a Skill\u001b[m\r\n\n  A typical skill lives as a directory (for example, inside \u001b[94m.agents/skills/<skill-name>/\u001b[m):\n\n\u001b[86D\u001b[38;5;252mskills/<skill-name>/\u001b[m\n\u001b[20D\u001b[38;5;252m├── SKILL.md"]
[0.000, "o", " \u001b[9b# Entry point: metadata + step-by-step instructions\u001b[m\n\u001b[73D\u001b[38;5;252m├── scripts/ \u001b[9b# Optional: Executable scripts/tools for complex commands\u001b[m\n\u001b[79D\u001b[38;5;252m├── references/ \u001b[6b# Optional: In-depth documentation loaded only when needed\u001b[m\n\u001b[80D\u001b[38;5;252m├── examples/ \u001b[8b# Optional: Code snippets or reference implementations\u001b[m\n\u001b[76D\u001b[38;5;252m└── resources/ \u001b[7b# Optional: Assets, templates, or schemas\u001b[m\r\n\n  \u001b[1m#### Exam\u001b[m\r\n⣽  \u001b[90mLoading...\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m└ Tip: Use /voice (or press f5) to record your prompt with your microphone.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[94m>\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m──────────────────────"]
