[0.349, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[27A\u001b[K\r\nResume with -c (or command below):\u001b[K\r\nagy --conversation=1147c739-09e2-4a91-95b7-8301c0303886\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J\n\u001b[4C\u001b[38;5;252mFollow these steps to deploy a temporary preview environment:\u001b[m\n\u001b[61D\u001b[38;5;70;1m1.\u001b[38;5;252;22m Run \u001b[38;5;214m`./scripts/verify-creds.sh`\u001b[38;5;252m.\u001b[m\n\u001b[35D\u001b[38;5;70;1m2.\u001b[38;5;252;22m Generate the preview stack with \u001b[38;5;214m`pulumi up --stack preview`\u001b[38;5;252m.\u001b[m\n\u001b[63D\u001b[38;5;70;1m3.\u001b[38;5;252;22m Check status via the endpoint printed in output logs.\u001b[m\r\n  ──────\r\n  \u001b[1m### 4. How Skills Compare to Rules and Tools\u001b[m\r\n\n   Customization | What It Represents \u001b[6b| How It Is Used\u001b[18X\u001b[18C| Example\r\n  -\u001b[14b|-\u001b[25b|-\u001b[32b|-\u001b[33b\r\n   \u001b[1mRules\u001b[m \u001b[8b| Guardrails & constraints | Applied passively / \u001b[12b| \"Always use TypeScript strict\r\n\t\t |\u001b[26X\u001b[26C| continuously\u001b[20X\u001b[20C| mode\"\r\n   \u001b[1mTools / MCP\u001b[m   | Capabilities / \"Hands\"   | Primitives the agent calls \u001b[5b| Run shell commands, fetch URLs,\r\n\t\t |\u001b[26X\u001b[26C| directly\u001b[24X\u001b[24C| query DB\r\n "]
[0.000, "o", "  \u001b[1mSkills\u001b[m \u001b[7b| Playbooks / Workflows    | Loaded conditionally on demand  | Step-by-step procedure to\r\n\t\t |\u001b[26X\u001b[26C|\u001b[33X\u001b[33C| migrate an API schema\r\n  ──────\r\n  \u001b[1m### 5. Why They Matter\u001b[m\r\n\n  • \u001b[1mTeam Consistency\u001b[m: You can commit skills into your Git repository so every engineer and AI agent follows the\r\n  exact same process.\r\n  • \u001b[1mReliability\u001b[m: Eliminates trial-and-error by providing concrete commands, verification steps, and error-\r\n  recovery advice.\r\n  • \u001b[1mContext Efficiency\u001b[m: Keeps the agent fast and context-efficient by loading deep technical documentation only\r\n  when actively working on that task.\r\n\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[94m>"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90mpress ctrl+d again to exit\u001b[m\u001b[67X\u001b[67C\u001b[2mGemini 3.8 Flash · high\u001b[m\r\u001b[2A\u001b[2C\u001b[?2026l"]
